  "item_short_desc": "<p>Crafted for everyday style and endless comfort, elevate your athletic wear with our Womens Essential Leggings with Pockets. These comfortable leggings are designed with a high waisted full coverage elastic waistband that helps with tummy control and support. Featuring mobility enhancement gussets, the buttery-soft yoga pants allow you to move freely, ensuring you get the most out of your workout.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133409",
  "description": "<p>Crafted for everyday style and endless comfort, elevate your athletic wear with our Womens Essential Leggings with Pockets. These comfortable leggings are designed with a high waisted full coverage elastic waistband that helps with tummy control and support. Featuring mobility enhancement gussets, the buttery-soft yoga pants allow you to move freely, ensuring you get the most out of your workout. Pockets: The 7/8 high waist leggings feature 2 side pockets that provide ample space for everyday essentials. Perfect Fit: Crafted with a super soft polyester / spandex blend, the form-fitting fabric stretches and shapes to your body. The high waisted leggings feature flat seams and 7/8 ankle length fit for a comfortable fit and feel. Quick Dry Fabric: The pocket leggings feature a moisture wicking material that keeps you cool and dry during high-intensity workouts and hot weather. Built for Endurance: These fitness leggings are perfect for jogging, running, hiking, biking, outdoor sports, yoga, any type of workout, and everyday wear. Complete the Look: As part of Rothco&rsquo;s Womens Essential Series, our leggings pair well with our Womens Tank Top and Womens Raglan Sleeve T-Shirt.</p>",
